## Evaluation Protocol

### Behavioral Tests (fast, ~30 sec, no Ragas)
| Test | Category | Assertion |
|---|---|---|
| `test_off_topic_refusal` | Out-of-Scope | Refusal phrase in response |
| `test_negative_constraint` | Negative | Excluded tech absent from answer |
| `test_aggregate_query` | Multi-hop | Multiple data points in answer |
| `test_robustness_typos` | Typos/Synonyms | Non-empty relevant answer |
| `test_colloquial_query` | Noisy input | Non-empty relevant answer |
| `test_ambiguous_level` | Ambiguous | Notes unavailable level |

### Golden Dataset
File: `app/backend/tests/eval_dataset_golden.json`
- 30+ questions across all 8 categories
- Each entry: `category`, `question`, `reference`, `expected_behavior`
- `expected_behavior` values: `answer`, `refusal`, `partial`

### Running Tests
```bash
# Behavioral tests only (fast, ~30 sec):
docker exec rags-backend-1 pytest -m behavioral -v

# Full Ragas eval (slow, ~20 min):
RUN_EVAL_TESTS=1 docker exec rags-backend-1 pytest -m eval -v

# Both:
RUN_EVAL_TESTS=1 docker exec rags-backend-1 pytest -m "behavioral or eval" -v
```

