## Development Rules

- Every new node MUST handle `state.get("intent")` defensively — fall back to `find_matching`
- `exclude_skills` filtering is done in `relevance_grader`, NOT in Qdrant queries (no structured index for skills)
- Generator prompts are intent-specific — do NOT add generic rules to a shared prompt
- `_CONSTRAINTS` block is appended to all generator prompts — do not duplicate its rules inline
- The `off_topic_responder` response text is fixed — do not make it LLM-generated
- Groundedness grader failure MUST discard the unsupported draft and retry with `grounding_feedback`; after `rag_max_retries`, return the normal fallback instead of delivering an ungrounded answer.
